<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PMC-Sierra raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PMC-Sierra raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said analyst Scott Randall raised his long-term rating on PMC-Sierra Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Kept short-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $0.94 per share from $0.89.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 earnings estimate to $1.10 per share from $1.06.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-15/16 to 30-7/8.</p>
</text>
